###User Register
POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName":"Anurag",
    "lastName":"Sharma",
    "email":"anurag.user@example.com",
    "password":"User@12345",
    "profileImageUrl":"http://example.com/avatars/user.png"

}

###User Login
POST http://localhost:4000/common-api/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"anurag.user@example.com",
    "password":"User@12345"

}


