###Create article (Author)
POST http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "author":"698979cc9fbd36444dfa5bec",
    "title":"test2 article",
    "category":"programming",
    "content":"article-2 content"
}


###Read all articles
GET http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles/698979cc9fbd36444dfa5bec



###Update article(AUTHOR)
PUT http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "author":"698979cc9fbd36444dfa5bec",
    "articleId":"6989820504c0e0d93559def6",
    "title":"test2 article",
    "category":"programming",
    "content":"article-2 content"
}


###Delete article (soft delete)
PUT http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles-delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "authorId":"698979cc9fbd36444dfa5bec",
    "articleId":"6989820504c0e0d93559def6"
}



